  "new_text": "<기획>\n카네코 아키후미"
 },
 {
  "offset": 685,
  "old_encoding": "utf16",
  "old_length_field": -106,
  "old_text": "　 <Voice Actors>\nKazuki Yao Yuriko Yamamoto\nShigeru Nakahara Toshiko Fujita\nNorio Wakamoto Kazuhiko Inoue",
  "new_text": "＜성우진＞\n야오 카즈키　      야마모토 유리코\n나카하라 시게루　후지타 토시코\n와카모토 노리오　이노우에 카즈히코"
 },
 {
  "offset": 995,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 85,
  "old_text": "Kaneto Shiozawa Shozo Iizuka\nKatsuji Mori Kazue Ikura\nKiyoyuki Yanada Junko Hagimori",
  "new_text": "시오자와 카네히토, 이이즈카 쇼조\n모리 코지, 이쿠라 카즈토\n야나다 키요유키, 하기모리 쿄코"
 },
 {
  "offset": 1120,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 4,
  "old_text": "Gia",
  "new_text": "지아"
 },
 {
  "offset": 1160,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 31,
  "old_text": "Hasa Village!\nMy beloved home!",
  "new_text": "내, 내 마을이!\n내 마을이 어떻게...!"
 },
 {
  "offset": 1233,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 6,
  "old_text": "Liana",
  "new_text": "리아나"
 },
 {
  "offset": 1271,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 22,
  "old_text": "No...\nHow dreadful...",
  "new_text": "너무해...\n어떻게 이런 짓을..."
 },
 {
  "offset": 1331,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 6,
  "old_text": "Lanzo",
  "new_text": "란조"
 },
 {
  "offset": 1355,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 14,
  "old_text": "Who's there?!",
  "new_text": "누구냐!"
 },
 {
  "offset": 1411,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 6,
  "old_text": "Lanzo",
  "new_text": "란조"
 },
 {
  "offset": 1443,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 14,
  "old_text": "Show yerself!",
  "new_text": "당장 튀어나와라!"
 },
 {
  "offset": 1499,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Fate",
  "new_text": "페이트"
 },
 {
  "offset": 1528,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 11,
  "old_text": "S-Sion...!",
  "new_text": "시, 시온...!"
 },
 {
  "offset": 1577,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 6,
  "old_text": "Liana",
  "new_text": "리아나"
 },
 {
  "offset": 1613,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 15,
  "old_text": "Why did you...",
  "new_text": "어째서... 당신이..."
 },
 {
  "offset": 1666,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Fate",
  "new_text": "페이트"
 },
 {
  "offset": 1717,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 28,
  "old_text": "Tell me!\nWhy'd you do this?",
  "new_text": "왜지\n네가 이런 짓을 저지르다니"
 },
 {
  "offset": 1781,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Sion",
  "new_text": "시온"
 },
 {
  "offset": 1850,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 64,
  "old_text": "I had no other choice,\nif humans wish to survive in this world.",
  "new_text": "어쩔 수 없는 일이다\n인간이 이 세계에서 살아남기 위해선"
 },
 {
  "offset": 1950,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Sion",
  "new_text": "시온"
 },
 {
  "offset": 2025,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 112,
  "old_text": "And if we helpless humans want to stand a chance against the \nmonsters then we must unite under a single ideal.",
  "new_text": "무력한 인간이 마물에 대항하려면\n이상 아래 하나로 뭉칠 수밖에 없다"
 },
 {
  "offset": 2177,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Sion",
  "new_text": "시온"
 },
 {
  "offset": 2230,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 66,
  "old_text": "The Darcanic teachings are the only power that can achieve \nthis.",
  "new_text": "다크교야말로 그것을 가능케 할 유일한 힘이다"
 },
 {
  "offset": 2334,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Fate",
  "new_text": "페이트"
 },
 {
  "offset": 2389,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 39,
  "old_text": "You don't really believe that, do you?",
  "new_text": "시온, 너 정말 진심으로 하는 소리냐"
 },
 {
  "offset": 2470,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 6,
  "old_text": "Liana",
  "new_text": "리아나"
 },
 {
  "offset": 2520,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 45,
  "old_text": "You killed all of the villagers... for that?",
  "new_text": "고작 그런 일을 위해서... 마을 사람들을..."
 },
 {
  "offset": 2601,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 4,
  "old_text": "Gia",
  "new_text": "지아"
 },
 {
  "offset": 2685,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 71,
  "old_text": "You attacked our village because they weren't\nfollowers of Darcanism?!",
  "new_text": "다크교를 믿지 않는다는 이유로,\n우리 마을을 습격했다는 거냐!"
 },
 {
  "offset": 2798,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 6,
  "old_text": "Lanzo",
  "new_text": "란조"
 },
 {
  "offset": 2832,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 16,
  "old_text": "Calm down, Gia!",
  "new_text": "지아, 진정해!"
 },
 {
  "offset": 2888,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Sion",
  "new_text": "시온"
 },
 {
  "offset": 2931,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 56,
  "old_text": "All of it... was in the name of peace across the lands.",
  "new_text": "모든 것은... 지상의 평화를 위해서다"
 },
 {
  "offset": 3029,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 6,
  "old_text": "Dewey",
  "new_text": "듀이"
 },
 {
  "offset": 3087,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 29,
  "old_text": "The Demon Gate has opened...",
  "new_text": "데몬 게이트... 결국 열리고 말았군..."
 },
 {
  "offset": 3156,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 4,
  "old_text": "Gia",
  "new_text": "지아"
 },
 {
  "offset": 3232,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 74,
  "old_text": "Monsters are pouring through the portal that has torn\nthrough our plane?!",
  "new_text": "공간에 뚫린 이 구멍을 통해...\n마물들이 쳐들어온다는 말인가...!"
 },
 {
  "offset": 3348,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 8,
  "old_text": "Merrows",
  "new_text": "멜로우즈"
 },
 {
  "offset": 3422,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 72,
  "old_text": "Is this the universal human utopia you harped on about?!\nWell, Lamium?!",
  "new_text": "이것이 네가 말한 인류 보편의 이상향이냐!\n라미암!"
 },
 {
  "offset": 3532,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 8,
  "old_text": "Merrows",
  "new_text": "멜로우즈"
 },
 {
  "offset": 3602,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 45,
  "old_text": "Fate! Use your sword to seal the Demon Gate!",
  "new_text": "페이트, 네 검으로 이 데몬 게이트를 막아라!"
 },
 {
  "offset": 3685,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Fate",
  "new_text": "페이트"
 },
 {
  "offset": 3718,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 11,
  "old_text": "But how...",
  "new_text": "하지만, 어떻게..."
 },
 {
  "offset": 3771,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 6,
  "old_text": "Dewey",
  "new_text": "듀이"
 },
 {
  "offset": 3873,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 78,
  "old_text": "The magic sword Luciedo is capable of it.\nYou need to believe in your powers!",
  "new_text": "마검 루시에도이라면 그 정도 힘은 있습니다.\n이제 당신 자신의 힘을 믿으세요!"
 },
 {
  "offset": 3989,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Fate",
  "new_text": "페이트"
 },
 {
  "offset": 4012,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 7,
  "old_text": "But...",
  "new_text": "하지만..."
 },
 {
  "offset": 4061,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 6,
  "old_text": "Dewey",
  "new_text": "듀이"
 },
 {
  "offset": 4105,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 14,
  "old_text": "W-Waaaggghhh!",
  "new_text": "윽, 으아아아아아아!!"
 },
 {
  "offset": 4161,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 6,
  "old_text": "Liana",
  "new_text": "리아나"
 },
 {
  "offset": 4189,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 7,
  "old_text": "Dewey!",
  "new_text": "듀이!"
 },
 {
  "offset": 4238,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Fate",
  "new_text": "페이트"
 },
 {
  "offset": 4277,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 19,
  "old_text": "Save him, Luciedo!",
  "new_text": "제발 닿아라! 루시에도!"
 },
 {
  "offset": 4336,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Alma",
  "new_text": "알마"
 },
 {
  "offset": 4359,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 4,
  "old_text": "Ah!",
  "new_text": "아악!"
 },
 {
  "offset": 4405,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 7,
  "old_text": "Marius",
  "new_text": "마리우스"
 },
 {
  "offset": 4432,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 6,
  "old_text": "Alma!",
  "new_text": "알마!"
 },
 {
  "offset": 4480,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 7,
  "old_text": "Lamium",
  "new_text": "라미암"
 },
 {
  "offset": 4541,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 45,
  "old_text": "Enough games. You're coming with me, Marius.",
  "new_text": "소꿉놀이는 끝이다. 함께 가줘야겠어, 마리우스."
 },
 {
  "offset": 4628,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 7,
  "old_text": "Marius",
  "new_text": "마리우스"
 },
 {
  "offset": 4665,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 9,
  "old_text": "Almaaaa!",
  "new_text": "알마아아아아!"
 },
 {
  "offset": 4710,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Alma",
  "new_text": "알마"
 },
 {
  "offset": 4797,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 67,
  "old_text": "It's okay... While this won't... make up for... \nall of my sins...",
  "new_text": "괜찮아요... 이걸로... 지금까지의... 죄가\n씻길 리는... 없겠지만..."
 },
 {
  "offset": 4906,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 6,
  "old_text": "Liana",
  "new_text": "리아나"
 },
 {
  "offset": 4934,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 15,
  "old_text": "Don't speak...",
  "new_text": "말하지 마..."
 },
 {
  "offset": 4985,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Alma",
  "new_text": "알마"
 },
 {
  "offset": 5128,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 129,
  "old_text": "That voice... Liana? Gosh...\nIt's strange. These eyes of mine are blind... \nyet I can see white wings...\nLike those of an angel!",
  "new_text": "그 목소리... 리아나 씨군요... 하아... (한숨)\n이상해요... 아무것도 보이지 않아야 할 내 눈에...\n하얀 깃털이 보여요. 그래요, 천사처럼!"
 },
 {
  "offset": 5299,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 6,
  "old_text": "Liana",
  "new_text": "리아나"
 },
 {
  "offset": 5367,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 45,
  "old_text": "Please, don't say any more!\nI can't...\nOh...",
  "new_text": "부탁이야! 이제 말하지 마...!\n나는 더 이상 아무도...\n앗..."
 },
 {
  "offset": 5450,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 6,
  "old_text": "Lanzo",
  "new_text": "란조"
 },
 {
  "offset": 5490,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 30,
  "old_text": "Whoa, this is something else.",
  "new_text": "흠. 이거 정말 대단한걸."
 },
 {
  "offset": 5558,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Fate",
  "new_text": "페이트"
 },
 {
  "offset": 5641,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 84,
  "old_text": "Not good! My feet should be firmly on the ground! \nDo something about this, please!",
  "new_text": "안 돼! 난 발이 땅에 안 닿아 있는 건 질색이야!\n어떻게 좀 해줘! 부탁이야!"
 },
 {
  "offset": 5761,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 4,
  "old_text": "Gia",
  "new_text": "지아"
 },
 {
  "offset": 5833,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 95,
  "old_text": "Such incredible powers. Who'd have thought that people \nreally did live in the Heavenly Realm?",
  "new_text": "훌륭한 힘이군. 하지만 정말로 천상계에\n사는 백성이 있었을 줄이야."
 },
 {
  "offset": 5966,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 6,
  "old_text": "Liana",
  "new_text": "리아나"
 },
 {
  "offset": 6124,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 202,
  "old_text": "The Heavenly Gate is much like a passageway that us angels \nuse to travel to the Overworld, which exists on a different \nplane. It allows us to save humans from the threat of \nthe devil's powers and...",
  "new_text": "성천문은 저희 천사들이 차원을 넘어 지상계를\n오가기 위한 통로 같은 곳이에요.\n악마의 힘에 위협받는 인간을 구하기 위해, 그리고..."
 },
 {
  "offset": 6362,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 4,
  "old_text": "Gia",
  "new_text": "지아"
 },
 {
  "offset": 6410,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 60,
  "old_text": "An overwhelmingly ominous presence... The presence of evil!",
  "new_text": "불길한 기운이 가득해... 마의 기운이다!"
 },
 {
  "offset": 6508,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Fate",
  "new_text": "페이트"
 },
 {
  "offset": 6541,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 26,
  "old_text": "An assassin from Lamium?!",
  "new_text": "라미암의 자객인가!"
 },
 {
  "offset": 6605,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 6,
  "old_text": "Liana",
  "new_text": "리아나"
 },
 {
  "offset": 6667,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 60,
  "old_text": "What?! How could we be attacked during a dimensional leap?!",
  "new_text": "말도 안 돼...! 차원 도약 중에 습격해 오다니!"
 },
 {
  "offset": 6765,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 6,
  "old_text": "Lanzo",
  "new_text": "란조"
 },
 {
  "offset": 6803,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 32,
  "old_text": "No point getting all worked up.",
  "new_text": "당황해 봤자 소용없어."
 },
 {
  "offset": 6877,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 6,
  "old_text": "Lanzo",
  "new_text": "란조"
 },
 {
  "offset": 6909,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 27,
  "old_text": "Here it comes! From above!",
  "new_text": "온다... 위다!"
 },
 {
  "offset": 6972,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Cael",
  "new_text": "케알"
 },
 {
  "offset": 7007,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 24,
  "old_text": "Long time no see, Enya.",
  "new_text": "오랜만이네, 엔야."
 },
 {
  "offset": 7071,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Enya",
  "new_text": "엔야"
 },
 {
  "offset": 7134,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 73,
  "old_text": "Oh? That voice... My goodness, all the unusual visitors \nI've had today.",
  "new_text": "어라, 그 목소리는... 오늘은 희한한 손님들이\n줄줄이 오는군."
 },
 {
  "offset": 7243,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Enya",
  "new_text": "엔야"
 },
 {
  "offset": 7294,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 30,
  "old_text": "Gosh... You really don't age.",
  "new_text": "허허... 여전히 늙지를 않는구먼."
 },
 {
  "offset": 7364,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Cael",
  "new_text": "케알"
 },
 {
  "offset": 7435,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 68,
  "old_text": "Time continues to flow around me... Yet for me, it remains \nfrozen.",
  "new_text": "내 주변의 시간은 흐르지만... 내 시간만은...\n멈춰 있으니까."
 },
 {
  "offset": 7543,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Enya",
  "new_text": "엔야"
 },
 {
  "offset": 7594,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 32,
  "old_text": "A century has already passed...",
  "new_text": "그때부터... 벌써 백 년은 됐겠지..."
 },
 {
  "offset": 7666,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Cael",
  "new_text": "케알"
 },
 {
  "offset": 7767,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 124,
  "old_text": "The curse that Lucifer cast in his dying moments has plunged \nme into a timeless hell where I must wander for all eternity.",
  "new_text": "그때, 단말마의 루키펠이 건 저주는 나를 영겁히\n방황하는 시간의 지옥으로 떨어뜨렸지."
 },
 {
  "offset": 7927,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Cael",
  "new_text": "케알"
 },
 {
  "offset": 7992,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 85,
  "old_text": "The agony of not being able to die... And the pain of not \nbeing able to see Claire.",
  "new_text": "인간으로서 죽지 못하는 고통...\n클레아 곁으로 갈 수 없는 슬픔."
 },
 {
  "offset": 8117,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Enya",
  "new_text": "엔야"
 },
 {
  "offset": 8220,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 105,
  "old_text": "But you can break your curse if you destroy all of the \nfragments of Lucifer scattered across the world.",
  "new_text": "하지만 그 속박이라도 세상에 흩어진 루키펠의\n육편을 모두 소멸시키면 풀리겠지."
 },
 {
  "offset": 8365,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 8,
  "old_text": "Raphael",
  "new_text": "라파엘"
 },
 {
  "offset": 8425,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 97,
  "old_text": "This was destined to happen as someone who crossed paths \nwith us possessors of the white wings.",
  "new_text": "필멸의 존재가 우리 하얀 날개의 백성에게\n관여하기 때문이다."
 },
 {
  "offset": 8558,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Cael",
  "new_text": "케알"
 },
 {
  "offset": 8583,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 9,
  "old_text": "Raphael.",
  "new_text": "라파엘"
 },
 {
  "offset": 8636,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 8,
  "old_text": "Raphael",
  "new_text": "라파엘"
 },
 {
  "offset": 8762,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 136,
  "old_text": "Liana herself neglected her duties by getting too close to \nhumans. You humans are an infectious disease... \nYou poison those near you.",
  "new_text": "리아나도 인간과 엮인 탓에 사명을 소홀히 했지.\n너희 인간들은 전염병 같구나... 곁에 있는 자부터 타락시키지."
 },
 {
  "offset": 8934,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Enya",
  "new_text": "엔야"
 },
 {
  "offset": 9017,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 88,
  "old_text": "Claire is from the heavens, just like you. I know she'd \nnever say something like that.",
  "new_text": "적어도 같은 천상인인 클레아는\n자네 같은 소리는 안 했네!"
 },
 {
  "offset": 9149,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 8,
  "old_text": "Raphael",
  "new_text": "라파엘"
 },
 {
  "offset": 9267,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 124,
  "old_text": "Heh. I didn't come here to trade insults...\nAn individual with Lucifer's cells lurking in them has \nappeared in this world.",
  "new_text": "훗... 오늘은 빈정거리러 온 게 아니다...\n이 세계에 루키펠 세포를 품은 자가 나타났다."
 },
 {
  "offset": 9435,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 8,
  "old_text": "Raphael",
  "new_text": "라파엘"
 },
 {
  "offset": 9521,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 96,
  "old_text": "Perhaps you should make haste to hunt them down and break \nthat spell of yours, cursed warrior.",
  "new_text": "어서 쫓아가서... 속박의 사슬을 끊어내는 게 어떠냐...\n저주받은 검사... 케알이여."
 },
 {
  "offset": 9653,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Alef",
  "new_text": "알레프"
 },
 {
  "offset": 9680,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 6,
  "old_text": "Cael!",
  "new_text": "케알 형!"
 },
 {
  "offset": 9722,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Cael",
  "new_text": "케알"
 },
 {
  "offset": 9781,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 36,
  "old_text": "Goodbye, Alef. I'm going to Claire.",
  "new_text": "잘 가라, 알레프. 나는 클레아 곁으로 갈게."
 },
 {
  "offset": 9857,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Alef",
  "new_text": "알레프"
 },
 {
  "offset": 9914,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 30,
  "old_text": "N-No... You're going to die?!",
  "new_text": "서, 설마... 죽는 거야!? 케알 형!"
 },
 {
  "offset": 9984,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Cael",
  "new_text": "케알"
 },
 {
  "offset": 10087,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 105,
  "old_text": "Heh... You've gotten so strong. Maybe as strong as your \ngreat-grandfather... Or possibly even stronger.",
  "new_text": "훗... 제법 강해졌구나... 네 증조할아버지뻘인\n분과 비슷할 정도로... 아니, 그 이상일지도."
 },
 {
  "offset": 10228,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Alef",
  "new_text": "알레프"
 },
 {
  "offset": 10387,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 101,
  "old_text": "What are yousaying? You've finally broken your curse!\nWhy do you have to die?!\nI don't get it! Why?!",
  "new_text": "무슨 소리야! 겨우 저주가 풀렸는데!\n왜 형이 죽어야 하는 건데!\n난 모르겠어! 대체 왜 그러는 거야!"
 },
 {
  "offset": 10530,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 6,
  "old_text": "Tiara",
  "new_text": "티아라"
 },
 {
  "offset": 10608,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 67,
  "old_text": "You fool! Cael's using his last ounce of strength to talk to \nyou!",
  "new_text": "바보 알레프! 케알 씨가 마지막 힘을 짜내서\n말하고 계시잖아!"
 },
 {
  "offset": 10711,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Cael",
  "new_text": "케알"
 },
 {
  "offset": 10828,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 129,
  "old_text": "Alef, I have a favor to ask. The sword that your \ngreat-grandfather wielded lies dormant in the Orchil Cave... \nTake that sword.",
  "new_text": "알레프... 네게 부탁이 있다... 네 증조할아버지가\n쓰시던 검이... 오킬의 동굴에 잠들어 있다... 그것을 손에..."
 },
 {
  "offset": 10997,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Cael",
  "new_text": "케알"
 },
 {
  "offset": 11110,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 101,
  "old_text": "Use it to protect this Overworld that Claire and I loved so \nmuch...\nFate, Liana, Tiara... and Alef.",
  "new_text": "나와 클레아가 사랑했던 이 지상계를... 지켜다오...\n페이트... 리아나... 티아라... 그리고... 알레프..."
 },
 {
  "offset": 11251,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Cael",
  "new_text": "케알"
 },
 {
  "offset": 11276,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 8,
  "old_text": "Thanks.",
  "new_text": "고맙다."
 },
 {
  "offset": 11328,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 8,
  "old_text": "Raphael",
  "new_text": "라파엘"
 },
 {
  "offset": 11380,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 52,
  "old_text": "Would it be appropriate to say... Well done, Liana?",
  "new_text": "잘했다... 라고 해야 할까? 리아나."
 },
 {
  "offset": 11474,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 6,
  "old_text": "Liana",
  "new_text": "리아나"
 },
 {
  "offset": 11508,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 9,
  "old_text": "Raphael!",
  "new_text": "라파엘 오라버니!"
 },
 {
  "offset": 11557,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 8,
  "old_text": "Raphael",
  "new_text": "라파엘"
 },
 {
  "offset": 11633,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 78,
  "old_text": "Liana... You descended from the heavens to protect this \nbeautiful Overworld.",
  "new_text": "리아나... 애초에 네가 강림한 것은\n아름다운 지상계를 지키기 위해서였다."
 },
 {
  "offset": 11751,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 8,
  "old_text": "Raphael",
  "new_text": "라파엘"
 },
 {
  "offset": 11877,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 143,
  "old_text": "But you've seen for yourself how frail and unsightly these \nhumans you're trying to protect are!\nUnleash a rain of fire from the heavens, now!",
  "new_text": "너도 보았겠지, 네가 지금 지키려는 인간의\n나약함과 추악함을! 자, 이제 천공에서 불의 비를 내려라."
 },
 {
  "offset": 12064,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 8,
  "old_text": "Raphael",
  "new_text": "라파엘"
 },
 {
  "offset": 12138,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 55,
  "old_text": "Purge the Overworld of these filthy demons and humans!",
  "new_text": "불결한 마족과 더불어, 인간을 이 지상계에서\n말살하는 것이다!"
 },
 {
  "offset": 12231,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Fate",
  "new_text": "페이트"
 },
 {
  "offset": 12274,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 37,
  "old_text": "Wait, Lia... Are you going with him?",
  "new_text": "기다려, 리아... 가버리는 거야?"
 },
 {
  "offset": 12355,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 8,
  "old_text": "Raphael",
  "new_text": "라파엘"
 },
 {
  "offset": 12503,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 171,
  "old_text": "Humans... I thank you for fighting against the demons on our \nbehalf.Now, wait for the flames of judgment... \nThis fate cannot be avoided. \nIt is the will of the heavens.",
  "new_text": "인간이여... 우리 대신 마족과 싸워준 것에 감사한다.\n이제 심판의 불꽃을 기다려라... 그것은 피할 수 없는 운명...\n천상계의 뜻이니라."
 },
 {
  "offset": 12716,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Fate",
  "new_text": "페이트"
 },
 {
  "offset": 12785,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 70,
  "old_text": "I didn't fight against the demons for the Overworld, nor for \nhumans.",
  "new_text": "내가 마물과 싸워온 건 지상계를 위해서도,\n인간을 위해서도 아니야."
 },
 {
  "offset": 12897,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Fate",
  "new_text": "페이트"
 },
 {
  "offset": 12938,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 61,
  "old_text": "It was so I could be with Lia... even if for a short time...",
  "new_text": "리아와... 조금이라도... 함께..."
 },
 {
  "offset": 13041,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Fate",
  "new_text": "페이트"
 },
 {
  "offset": 13078,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 15,
  "old_text": "Don't go! Lia!",
  "new_text": "가지 마! 리아!"
 },
 {
  "offset": 13135,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 6,
  "old_text": "Liana",
  "new_text": "리아나"
 },
 {
  "offset": 13157,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 4,
  "old_text": "Ah!",
  "new_text": "핫!"
 },
 {
  "offset": 13201,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 8,
  "old_text": "Raphael",
  "new_text": "라파엘"
 },
 {
  "offset": 13239,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 17,
  "old_text": "You fool! Liana!",
  "new_text": "말도 안 돼! 리아나!"
 },
 {
  "offset": 13294,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 6,
  "old_text": "Liana",
  "new_text": "리아나"
 },
 {
  "offset": 13436,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 129,
  "old_text": "I'm sorry, Raphael... You're right. Humans are unsightly \nbeings drowning in their desires.\nBut that does not describe them all.",
  "new_text": "죄송해요, 라파엘 오라버니... 오라버니 말씀대로\n인간들은 욕망에 찌든 추악한 존재였어요.\n하지만 그것이 전부는 아니에요."
 },
 {
  "offset": 13605,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 8,
  "old_text": "Raphael",
  "new_text": "라파엘"
 },
 {
  "offset": 13677,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 96,
  "old_text": "Stop! Are you really going to discard those your wings? \nThey're your pride as an angel, Liana!",
  "new_text": "그만둬! 하얀 날개를... 천사의 증표를 버리겠다는 거냐!\n리아나!"
 },
 {
  "offset": 13811,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 6,
  "old_text": "Liana",
  "new_text": "리아나"
 },
 {
  "offset": 13951,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 151,
  "old_text": "Mistakes will continue to be made in the Overworld.\nBut I think with every mistake, humans will find a way to \npave their own path towards the future.",
  "new_text": "앞으로도 지상계에서는 실수가 반복되겠죠.\n하지만 그때마다 인간은 스스로의 손으로\n자신의 앞날을 개척해 나갈 수 있을 거라 믿어요."
 },
 {
  "offset": 14140,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 6,
  "old_text": "Liana",
  "new_text": "리아나"
 },
 {
  "offset": 14170,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 22,
  "old_text": "My dear brother, I...",
  "new_text": "오라버니... 저는..."
 },
 {
  "offset": 14230,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 6,
  "old_text": "Liana",
  "new_text": "리아나"
 },
 {
  "offset": 14298,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 79,
  "old_text": "I have faith in the humans... and would like them to take \ncare of this world.",
  "new_text": "인간을 믿고... 이 지상계를 맡기고 싶어요."
 },
 {
  "offset": 14471,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 50,
  "old_text": "And I also want to watch over them... as a human!",
  "new_text": "그리고 저 자신도... 인간으로서 그것을 지켜보고 싶어요!"
 },
 {
  "offset": 14561,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 8,
  "old_text": "Raphael",
  "new_text": "라파엘"
 },
 {
  "offset": 14607,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 71,
  "old_text": "To think that I have accepted your choice to become a fallen \nangel...",
  "new_text": "타락천사의 선택을 인정하게 될 줄이야..."
 },
 {
  "offset": 14722,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 8,
  "old_text": "Raphael",
  "new_text": "라파엘"
 },
 {
  "offset": 14776,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 43,
  "old_text": "I suppose the humans have swayed me too...",
  "new_text": "나도 꽤나... 인간에게 감화된 모양이군..."
 },
 {
  "offset": 14857,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 6,
  "old_text": "Liana",
  "new_text": "리아나"
 },
 {
  "offset": 14897,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 12,
  "old_text": "Ahhh! Fate!",
  "new_text": "꺄아아! 페이트!"
 },
 {
  "offset": 14947,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Fate",
  "new_text": "페이트"
 },
 {
  "offset": 14972,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 7,
  "old_text": "Liana!",
  "new_text": "리아나!"
 },
 {
  "offset": 15025,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 13,
  "old_text": "Satan Lamium",
  "new_text": "라미암 사탄"
 },
 {
  "offset": 15128,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 103,
  "old_text": "My body will crumble here.\nBut so long as darkness lurks within the hearts of humans, \nI shall return!",
  "new_text": "내 육체는 여기서 멸하리라.\n하지만 인간의 마음에 어둠의 영역이 있는 한,\n나는 반드시 부활한다!"
 },
 {
  "offset": 15281,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 13,
  "old_text": "Satan Lamium",
  "new_text": "라미암 사탄"
 },
 {
  "offset": 15354,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 72,
  "old_text": "For when that day comes, \nI shall absorb this maiden and make her mine!",
  "new_text": "그날을 위해 이 소녀를 흡수하여 내 것으로 만들겠다!"
 },
 {
  "offset": 15468,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Fate",
  "new_text": "페이트"
 },
 {
  "offset": 15517,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 20,
  "old_text": "Wait, Liana!\nUgh...",
  "new_text": "기다려, 리아나!\n우오! 윽!..."
 },
 {
  "offset": 15575,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Fate",
  "new_text": "페이트"
 },
 {
  "offset": 15598,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 8,
  "old_text": "Argh...",
  "new_text": "구헉..."
 },
 {
  "offset": 15648,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Fate",
  "new_text": "페이트"
 },
 {
  "offset": 15687,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 18,
  "old_text": "S-Sion... You...!",
  "new_text": "시... 시온... 이 자식이...!"
 },
 {
  "offset": 15745,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Sion",
  "new_text": "시온"
 },
 {
  "offset": 15816,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 64,
  "old_text": "We can't lose the hero who saved the humans and the \nOverworld.",
  "new_text": "인간을... 지상계를 구한 영웅을 잃을 수는 없지."
 },
 {
  "offset": 15920,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Sion",
  "new_text": "시온"
 },
 {
  "offset": 16005,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 81,
  "old_text": "Please, magic sword Luciedo.\nGive me the power to protect Liana, just this once!",
  "new_text": "부탁한다... 마검 루시에도.\n지금 이 순간만이라도... 나에게 리아나를\n지킬 힘을 빌려줘!"
 },
 {
  "offset": 16122,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Sion",
  "new_text": "시온"
 },
 {
  "offset": 16149,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 11,
  "old_text": "Take that!",
  "new_text": "이얍!"
 },
 {
  "offset": 16198,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Fate",
  "new_text": "페이트"
 },
 {
  "offset": 16239,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 39,
  "old_text": "Stop, Sion! Do you have a death wish?!",
  "new_text": "그만둬, 시온! 죽으려는 거냐!"
 },
 {
  "offset": 16318,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 5,
  "old_text": "Sion",
  "new_text": "시온"
 },
 {
  "offset": 16345,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 7,
  "old_text": "Gahhh!",
  "new_text": "우오오오!"
 },
 {
  "offset": 16402,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
  "old_length_field": 13,
  "old_text": "Satan Lamium",
  "new_text": "라미암 사탄"
 },
 {
  "offset": 16437,
  "old_encoding": "ascii",
